1
A58-charging in tRNA isodecoders and their changes upon stress. For seven out of eight 4-codon-box amino acid families (Gly, Arg, Leu, Pro, Ser, Val, Thr; Ala is the exception), we detected significantly different ORs between tRNAs with A/T versus C/G at wobble anticodon position 34 in many conditions (Figure
