Leu
(CAA)-1. For 50–59 fragmentation the odds ratios are negative for tRNA
Leu
(TAA)-1 and tRNA
Leu
(AAG)-2, but positive for tRNA
Leu
(CAA)-1. These results indicate that a single tRNA modification can have both stimulatory and inhibitory effects on tRNA fragmentation; whether stimulatory or inhibitory depends on the specific tRNA and the location of cleavage.
